<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-NATAL V AUSTRALIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NATAL V AUSTRALIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
